# Optional: production CORS proxy for NanoGPT subscription usage.
# Required on static hosts (e.g. GitHub Pages) until NanoGPT enables CORS on
# GET /api/subscription/v1/usage. Local `npm run dev` uses Vite's /__nanogpt proxy.
#
# Deploy workers/nanogpt-usage-proxy then set:
# VITE_NANOGPT_PROXY=https://character-vault-nanogpt-usage.<account>.workers.dev
# VITE_NANOGPT_PROXY=
